Shopping Cart System (Java Console Application)

A simple Java-based Shopping Cart System built using Object-Oriented Programming principles and 
the Decorator Pattern for applying product offers.

Features:
  Add products to cart
  Display all products
  Update product price
  Remove products from cart
  Apply offers (5% or 10% discount)
  Auto-generated Product IDs
  Menu-driven console interface

Technologies Used:
  Java
  ArrayList
  Interfaces
  Abstract Classes
  Decorator Pattern
  Iterator

Supported Products:
  Shirt
  T-Shirt
  Pant

Concepts Practiced:
  Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)
  Interface-based design
  Factory-like object creation
  Decorator Pattern
  Collection Framework (ArrayList)
  Iterator for safe deletion
  Exception Handling
